SECTION | KEY | VALUE
----------------------------------------
# nav.pdl - the sidebar buttons of the pet trainer window, per view. Edit here (or in the layout studio); pet_event.sh status turns every row into nav_<i>_label/verb/arg.
# NAV | view | label | verb | arg      view = room | manage | world. Special label {party} = one row per pet (label "<n> <name>", arg = pet id). A verb runs: pet_event.sh <verb> <arg>.
NAV | room   | Go outside (World)   | view       | world
NAV | room   | Pet: living room     | teleport   | living 50
NAV | room   | Pet: bedroom         | teleport   | bedroom 320
NAV | room   | Build room (right)   | build_room | right room
NAV | room   | Build room (left)    | build_room | left room
NAV | room   | Build garden (right) | build_room | right garden
NAV | room   | Map (toggle)         | map        | -
NAV | manage | {party}              | select     | {id}
NAV | manage | < Back to the house  | view       | room
NAV | world  | Up                   | world_move | up
NAV | world  | Down                 | world_move | down
NAV | world  | Left                 | world_move | left
NAV | world  | Right                | world_move | right
NAV | world  | Talk to nearby       | world_talk | -
NAV | world  | Tii-monsters | party_toggle | -
NAV | world  | < Back to the house  | view       | room
# worldparty = the village with the Player menu open: the trainer's inventory is the six tii-monsters; picking one goes into its room.
NAV | worldparty | {party}            | select       | {id}
NAV | worldparty | < Close the list   | party_toggle | -
